<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Amgold half yr share, div rise.</title>
<headline>Amgold half yr share, div rise.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended September 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr, headline (cts)	 753     vs    649</p>
<p>    Shr, net earnings (cts)   948     vs    1,091</p>
<p>    Div (cts)		     730     vs    640</p>
<p>    Net earnings		  229     vs    264</p>
<p>    Pre-tax			 233     vs    273</p>
<p>    Tax				 4     vs	9</p>
<p>    Investment income	   190     vs    156</p>
<p>Surplus on realisation</p>
<p>    of investments		 47     vs    107</p>
<p>Div payable: December 6</p>
<p>on register: November 1</p>
<p>Full name: Anglo American Gold Investment Co Ltd (mining financial)</p>
<p>NOTE - Results for the second half of the financial year ended March 31 1997 would depend largely on the prevailing rand gold price, productivity and working cost containment during the second half of the calendar year to December 31, the company said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
